The reference for your Ticket Request made via Qantas Agency Connect is:<br />
{{{Case.CaseNumber}}}<br />
<br />
We are unable to action your request for the following reason:</p>

<ul>
	<li>The EMD has been incorrectly issued. EMD must be issued with the service code ICSF as per the QAC EMD policy</li>
	<li>All EMD payments should be made at the nett level and as a lump sum including fares, taxes, change fee and QAC service fee where applicable</li>
	<li>The QAC service fee has not been received.</li>
	<li>The flight/s have been cancelled</li>
	<li>No fare reassessment has been provided by QAC.</li>
	<li>Passport information has not been added to the booking.</li>
	<li>The ticket can be reissued in-house.</li>
</ul>

<p>&nbsp;<br />
Please submit a new request which meets our requirements.<br />
